msgctxt "64"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"What's the matter, grandpa? Speak up! It ain't like we're tryin'\r\n"
"to mug you or nothin'. We're real upstanding youth, see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Hey... What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Dammit... We gotta bounce."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "And I thought for sure we had that old dude in the bag, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr "Tutto bene?"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I am. Thank you for that. They just wouldn't leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You still look worried. Is there something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"No, no... I'm just a little pooped out, that's all.\r\n"
"It's been quite some time since I was back in this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"In fact, it's been more than sixty years... Back in the\r\n"
"postwar days, this place was one big black market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Which reminds me... There's something I'd like to ask you. Would you happen "
"to have heard of a <Color:7>Suppon Street<Color:Default> somewhere around "
"here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Suppon Street?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I've got some business with a bar on Suppon Street,\r\n"
"goes by the name of Jinsei. I thought I knew where it was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"But damn if this place hasn't changed in sixty years! I feel\r\n"
"like a complete newcomer. Not to mention I've been walking\r\n"
"so much, I can barely stand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I hate to take advantage of your kindness, but do you think\r\n"
"you could find me that Jinsei place on Suppon Street and let\r\n"
"me know how to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I need to rest here a little longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "(So, I'm looking for a Jinsei on Suppon Street...)"
msgstr ""

